From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DeepSeek Harness <noreply@deepseek.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 08:37:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Cache rasterized app icons and stabilize list items

ApplicationIcon used to run drawable.toBitmap() on every composition, so
scrolling the usage list re-allocated one bitmap per visible row. The
bitmaps are now memoized per package in a small LRU cache (4 MB, sized by
real bitmap bytes) and list items have stable keys/content types. Chart
value lists on the analysis screen are also remembered instead of being
re-built on every recomposition.
